---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section id="work" class="section container" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE THINGS I BUILD</p><h2 id="work-title">Here’s what I’m up to.</h2></div><p>Building Minicor today.<br /> Growing businesses in agriculture, too.</p></div>
  <article class="featured-work">
    <div class="featured-copy">
      <div class="featured-top"><span class="pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> My main focus</span><span class="work-role">Co-founder & CTO</span></div>
      <h3>Minicor<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3>
      <p class="featured-intro">AI for reasoning.<br /> Deterministic execution.</p>
      <p class="featured-description">We’re building deterministic computer use. Desktop and browser workflows become APIs: AI reasons about the task, while execution follows explicit steps with people in control.</p>
      <a class="text-link light-link" href={profile.minicor} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore Minicor <Arrow diagonal /></a>
    </div>
    <aside class="founder-note" aria-label="Why I’m building Minicor">
      <span class="note-label">WHY I’M BUILDING THIS</span>
      <h4>I love AI.<br />And I love this work.</h4>
      <p>In medicine, insurance, and finance, I want AI’s reasoning to be useful while people stay in control of execution. That’s what makes building Minicor exciting to me.</p>
      <a class="quiet-link" href={profile.ycStory} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Our path to YC <Arrow diagonal /></a>
    </aside>
  </article>
  <div class="other-work-heading"><h3>Beyond the laptop</h3><p>A few other businesses I’ve put my energy into.</p></div>
  <div class="venture-grid">
    <article class="venture-card palm-card">
      <div class="venture-top"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M29 55c-1-10 1-25 6-34M34 23c-9-8-20-6-26 1m26-2C31 10 20 7 14 9m22 12c1-9 8-15 14-13M35 23c10-8 20-5 23 1M36 24c10 0 17 5 19 11M35 21c-7-3-16 4-18 11M15 55h32" /></svg><span>Owner</span></div>
      <h3>Oil palm plantation</h3><p>Eighteen hectares. A long-term investment in growing and producing something tangible.</p><div class="venture-detail"><strong>18</strong><span>hectares of oil palm</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="venture-card farm-card">
      <div class="venture-top"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M33 36c0 10-6 16-14 16S5 46 5 36 12 13 19 13s14 13 14 23ZM59 37c0 10-6 16-14 16-6 0-10-3-12-8M34 22c3-6 7-10 11-10 7 0 14 15 14 25" /></svg><span>Owner</span></div>
      <h3>Layer chicken farm</h3><p>A poultry business focused on egg production. Another side of my interest in building productive businesses.</p><div class="venture-detail"><span class="detail-dot"></span><span>Food & agriculture</span></div>
    </article>
    <article class="venture-card lucky-card">
      <div class="venture-top"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 15h50v11a7 7 0 0 0 0 14v10H7V40a7 7 0 0 0 0-14V15Z"/><path d="m30 22 4 7 8 2-6 6 1 8-7-4-7 4 1-8-6-6 8-2 4-7ZM47 16v5m0 23v5" /></svg><span>Previously launched</span></div>
      <h3>Lucky Star</h3><p>A lottery company I launched. A different industry, and an earlier chapter of my life as an entrepreneur.</p><a class="quiet-link" href="https://guardian.ng/news/firm-rewards-customers-with-n1m-prize-gifts/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">A little of its story <Arrow diagonal /></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
